dialogs
0	TATE: Looks like the bond between you and your POKéMON is far stronger than the bond that we share as twins.LIZA: You will become even stronger! We've battled you, so we know.
1	The indecisive lose. That's my warning to you.
2	A POKé BALL was too heavy to lift psychically. But this dust bunny…Whoooooooooooooooh! … … … … … …No, I'm not cheating! I didn't blow on it! Honestly!
3	A bright future awaits those who have worked diligently.For those who lazed idly, there is only despair at the end.What goes around comes around…
4	You will wage a terrifically intense battle with our GYM LEADERS…The result… You won't hear it from me!
5	If there are prodigies in the world, then our GYM LEADERS are them!However, you may be even more talented than them…
6	I'm not going to get down on myself for losing. I just need to train harder.Positive thinking--that's my strong point!
7	Yo, how's it going, CHAMPION-bound PLAYER?The GYM LEADERS here use PSYCHIC-type POKéMON.If you go up against them with FIGHTING- or POISON-type POKéMON, they'll inflict horrible damage!Plus, they'll come at you with outstanding combination attacks.If you want to win, you'll need to show them how tight you are with your POKéMON. Go for it!
8	TATE: Looks like the bond between you and your POKéMON is far stronger than the bond that we share as twins.LIZA: You will become even stronger! We've battled you, so we know.
16	I… I don't let defeat rattle m-me, however b-badly.
17	How dare you beat me…It won't be my fault if something horrible befalls you…
24	It seems that I could not overcome your youthful energy.
26	Humph! You may be strong, but you're not suitable for the PSYCHIC type!The way you battle is somehow brutal!
27	Your vitality is contagious! Get away from me quickly!
31	All right! I think I'll develop a special invincible POKéMON power next.
