faceplayer
goto_if_set FLAG_DEFEATED_MOSSDEEP_GYM MossdeepCity_Gym_EventScript_GymGuidePostVictory
msgbox	Yo, how's it going, CHAMPION-bound PLAYER?The GYM LEADERS here use PSYCHIC-type POKéMON.If you go up against them with FIGHTING- or POISON-type POKéMON, they'll inflict horrible damage!Plus, they'll come at you with outstanding combination attacks.If you want to win, you'll need to show them how tight you are with your POKéMON. Go for it!
release
end
= MossdeepCity_Gym_EventScript_GymGuidePostVictory
msgbox	Wow, you're astounding! You're one great TRAINER!
release
end
@ Leftover from RS functionally unused
goto MossdeepCity_Gym_EventScript_LeftGymStatue
= MossdeepCity_Gym_EventScript_LeftGymStatue
lockall
goto_if_set FLAG_BADGE07_GET MossdeepCity_Gym_EventScript_GymStatueCertified
goto MossdeepCity_Gym_EventScript_GymStatue
end
= MossdeepCity_Gym_EventScript_GymStatue
msgbox	MOSSDEEP CITY POKéMON GYM
releaseall
end
= MossdeepCity_Gym_EventScript_GymStatueCertified
msgbox	MOSSDEEP CITY POKéMON GYMLIZA AND TATE'S CERTIFIED TRAINERS: PLAYER
releaseall
end
= MossdeepCity_Gym_EventScript_Hannah
trainerbattle_single TRAINER_HANNAH MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_HannahIntro MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_HannahDefeat
msgbox	I'm not going to get down on myself for losing. I just need to train harder.Positive thinking--that's my strong point!
end
= MossdeepCity_Gym_EventScript_Virgil
trainerbattle_single TRAINER_VIRGIL MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_VirgilIntro MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_VirgilDefeat
msgbox	If there are prodigies in the world, then our GYM LEADERS are them!However, you may be even more talented than them…
end
= MossdeepCity_Gym_EventScript_Samantha
trainerbattle_single TRAINER_SAMANTHA MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_SamanthaIntro MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_SamanthaDefeat
msgbox	You will wage a terrifically intense battle with our GYM LEADERS…The result… You won't hear it from me!
end
= MossdeepCity_Gym_EventScript_Maura
trainerbattle_single TRAINER_MAURA MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_MauraIntro MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_MauraDefeat
msgbox	A bright future awaits those who have worked diligently.For those who lazed idly, there is only despair at the end.What goes around comes around…
end
= MossdeepCity_Gym_EventScript_Blake
trainerbattle_single TRAINER_BLAKE MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_BlakeIntro MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_BlakeDefeat
msgbox	A POKé BALL was too heavy to lift psychically. But this dust bunny…Whoooooooooooooooh! … … … … … …No, I'm not cheating! I didn't blow on it! Honestly!
end
= MossdeepCity_Gym_EventScript_Preston
trainerbattle_single TRAINER_PRESTON MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_PrestonIntro MossdeepCity_Gym_Text_PrestonDefeat
msgbox	The indecisive lose. That's my warning to you.
end
